{"speciesId":464,"names":{"fr":"Rhinastoc","es":"Rhyperior","en":"Rhyperior","ja":"ドサイドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. GEODUDE are shot at rare times."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. GEODUDE are shot at rare times."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"From holes in its palms, it fires out GEODUDE. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"From holes in its palms, it fires out GEODUDE. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il peut lancer des pierres à une vitesse saisissante en bandant et relâchant ses muscles en un éclair."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut lancer des pierres à une vitesse saisissante en bandant et relâchant ses muscles en un éclair."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses paumes projettent des Racaillou, et son corps couvert de Protecteurs résiste même à une éruption volcanique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lanza Geodude por los agujeros de las manos. Gracias a Protector resiste erupciones volcánicas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"手のひらの 穴から イシツブテを 発射。全身の プロテクターは 火山の 噴火にも 耐えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il bande ses muscles pour projeter des pierres ou des Racaillou depuis le creux de ses paumes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Pone rocas en los agujeros de sus manos y las lanza con los músculos. A veces lanza Geodude."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. Geodude are shot at rare times."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"岩を 手のひらの 穴に つめて 筋肉の 力で 発射する。 まれに イシツブテを 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses paumes projettent des Racaillou, et son corps couvert de Protecteurs résiste même à une éruption volcanique."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lanza Geodude por los agujeros de las manos. Gracias a Protector resiste erupciones volcánicas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"手のひらの 穴から イシツブテを 発射。全身の プロテクターは 火山の 噴火にも 耐えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il bande ses muscles pour projeter des pierres ou des Racaillou depuis le creux de ses paumes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pone rocas en los agujeros de sus manos y las lanza con los músculos. A veces lanza Geodude."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. Geodude are shot at rare times."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"岩を 手のひらの 穴に つめて 筋肉の 力で 発射する。 まれに イシツブテを 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il met des rochers ou des Nodulithe dans le creux de ses mains et les tire comme des obus. Il peut ainsi en charger trois par bras."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Introduce rocas o Roggenrola en las cavidades de las manos y los dispara con fuerza. Es capaz de cargar hasta tres proyectiles en cada brazo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It can load up to three projectiles per arm into the holes in its hands. What launches out of those holes could be either rocks or Roggenrola."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"手の 穴に 岩や ダンゴロを 詰めて 発射。 装填できる 数は 片腕に つき ３つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il repousse les attaques avec ses Protecteurs et profite du moment où l’adversaire est déstabilisé pour le transpercer avec sa vrille, dont il est fier."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Repele los ataques usando un Protector y aprovecha el momento en que el rival baja la guardia para perforarlo con su taladro."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It relies on its carapace to deflect incoming attacks and throw its enemy off balance. As soon as that happens, it drives its drill into the foe."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"プロテクターで 攻撃を 弾き 相手が ひるんだ ところを 自慢の ドリルで つらぬく。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This Pokémon evolved through use of a curious item. Its rocklike hide is composed of a mysterious substance and can withstand a blow from a masterwork sword with nary a scratch."}],"varieties":[{"id":464,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","lear